	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/video_settings/performance/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Leave out passes for a slower machine: shine and\nreflections, then shadows and decals, then fog."/>
		<string text="Objects use their coarser models sooner, and small\nfar ones vanish. Full: as the game chooses."/>
		<string text="Which rooms are drawn. Portals: those the doors\nshow. PVS: the map's stored set; a lighter search."/>
		<string text="Lowers the detail a step at a time to hold this frame\nrate, and raises it again. Ctrl+Minus/Equals by hand."/>
		<string text="Smaller world textures: less video memory. Applies\nto textures loaded after the change (next map)."/>
		<string text="Skip a level's cutscenes by themselves, for a slow\nmachine. Single player only; co-op still votes."/>
		<string text="The display's gamma, for a screen darker than the\nXbox's television. 1.0 leaves it alone."/>
	</strings>
